[{"title":"古镜","author":"徐渭","text":"白日淘抔土，青天射两丸。\n且须防薄蚀，讵止鉴衣冠。\n神物含光易，深山识宝难。\n不知丘壑里，还掩几冰团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39055,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈女度尼","author":"徐渭","text":"青春正及笄，削发度为尼。\n别母留妆粉，参师歇画眉。\n幻真临镜现，生灭带花知。\n未必今来悟，前身受记谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39056,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠相士","author":"徐渭","text":"节钺下明州，东随一剑留。\n帷中占胜色，市上立清秋。\n碧眼胡僧避，青囊道侣求。\n相逢多暮客，曾见李藩不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39057,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分赋得吴山送俞君还赣","author":"徐渭","text":"吴山碧石头，雄抱浙江流。\n大可兴云雨，微还适览游。\n常登应结恋，乍别不能留。\n明朝翠色远，尔知在行舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39058,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芸阁校书篇","author":"徐渭","text":"薄雾霭香筒，青缃走蠹虫。\n一梯陟刘向，万帙映杨雄。\n鸟下窥书古，花飞缀字红。\n他年在天禄，羞与俗人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39059,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮云居松下眺城南","author":"徐渭","text":"夕照不曾残，城头月正团。\n霞光翻鸟堕，江色上松寒。\n市客屠俱集，高空醉屡看。\n何妨高渐离，抱却筑来弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39060,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内兄潘伯海谒选","author":"徐渭","text":"之人千里行，言宴款郊城。\n牵尔衣裳处，糿予帷幕情。\n见兄兼念妹，送舅祗携甥。\n明岁承恩日，龙池万柳青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39061,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省试周大夫赠篇罢归赋此","author":"徐渭","text":"十谒九不荐，那能长作儒。\n江光凌弃壁，关色黯归繻。\n薇蕨求新主，羹汤问小姑。\n风雷亦何限，终是恼凡鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39062,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丰吏部公邀泛西湖观荷明日寄作令与嘉则叙父追和","author":"徐渭","text":"吏部元耽饮，良辰尊俎携。\n分明在湖上，记得似耶溪。\n别浦红裙桨，垂杨白马堤。\n茫茫荷叶路，共水入天西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39063,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鹇","author":"徐渭","text":"片雪簇寒衣，玄丝绣一围。\n都缘惜文采，长得侍光辉。\n提赐朱笼窄，羁栖碧汉违。\n短檐侧目处，天际看鸿飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39064,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"来青亭","author":"徐渭","text":"画栋将云绕，修檐傍汉开。\n亭非邀翠入，山自送青来。\n远色虚难写，遐观纵未回。\n共言春景丽，不见使人猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39065,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦与肖甫较射","author":"徐渭","text":"烟光海日曈，青帝早司东。\n候转弓犹劲，标疏的略红。\n耦弯双月吐，长臂一猿通。\n本是无争者，心知此际雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39066,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季长沙公哀词","author":"徐渭","text":"槐树宛低回，犹疑讲席开。\n死因双宿去，生为六经来。\n绕瑟飞春水，传灯暗夜台。\n三年更筑室，未了独居怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39067,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮大夫园林","author":"徐渭","text":"万树梅花国，垂帘试一凭。\n高楼烟欲暮，远岫雪将晴。\n帆舫时时渡，溪桥处处横。\n若耶无限景，都有此中情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39068,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高叟入燕","author":"徐渭","text":"少小幽燕客，重游白发多。\n人钦旧然诺，客和古悲歌。\n红叶淮流舫，黄尘沛县骡。\n向来沽酒处，留得几娇娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39069,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"背树","author":"徐渭","text":"背树零宵露，羁魂断晓铺。\n正当愁画地，谁遣放啼乌。\n拭泪身仍系，酬恩计转迂。\n应劳垂老魄，结草向冥途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39070,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得看剑引杯长","author":"徐渭","text":"高会莫匆匆，鱼肠把似公。\n睥睨寸心在，慷慨百壶空。\n客散平原夜，波寒易水风。\n秦雠不能报，泪落酒杯红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39071,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得暗尘随马去","author":"徐渭","text":"春夕丽春灯，芳尘似有情。\n难随罗袜缓，却逐马蹄轻。\n高缕迷鞍浅，低光影镫平。\n酒家莫留系，一夜遍都城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39072,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得芹芽","author":"徐渭","text":"青春曲水湄，芹吐小芽滋。\n在野未堪摘，献君知几时。\n暖风来燕子，寒食伴棠梨。\n一夜休教老，留尖煮鲙丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39073,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇江","author":"徐渭","text":"落日挂城角，孤蓬憩水窗。\n草长交浦断，潮大入河降。\n笋蔌辞乡饭，樱桃过镇江。\n吴船夫妇唱，十曲九成双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39074,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王山人丹房","author":"徐渭","text":"山房在何所，宛在水中央。\n丹灶泥初湿，红颜药正黄。\n菱花归舫乱，荷叶过人长。\n一自弹渔鼓，陶陶醉几场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39075,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲春李子遂季子牙史叔考坐雨禹迹寺景贤祠中醉馀赋诗并用街字子遂来自建阳一别数载","author":"徐渭","text":"病久不到此，荒祠草上阶。\n阴晴连日异，闽越几年怀。\n夜梵潮三丈，春酥雨一街。\n梨花无月处，有客醉金钗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39076,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"法相寺看活石","author":"徐渭","text":"莲花不在水，分叶簇青山。\n径折虽能入，峰迷不可还。\n取蒲量石长，问竹到溪湾。\n莫怪淹斜日，明朝恐未閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39077,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侣琴篇为赵子赋","author":"徐渭","text":"岂无兰蕙好，独结峄阳桐。\n养鹤多因尔，游鱼亦为侬。\n风雷县一壁，山水伴千重。\n一作梅花弄，都令雪满空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39078,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝刀诗","author":"徐渭","text":"双钮黑银镂，来从大土酋。\n绦绒结蛮女，铁色照并州。\n不惜金千镒，能县水一沟。\n床头好珍重，兼许茂先收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39079,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答谢上谷诸公","author":"徐渭","text":"一客宣城镇，真多地主良。\n停车松树下，投辖井中央。\n红烛筹枚满，苍毛尘话长。\n别来知几日，柳色满红墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39080,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书箑赠顾鸿胪","author":"徐渭","text":"廿载神交后，尺书长跪辰。\n涸鱼幸不死，闰月亦徒春。\n碧柳深高馆，红云近侍臣。\n相过不能数，叔夜懒方真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39081,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王口北见遗貂帽因往","author":"徐渭","text":"一围消雪远，两翅辟尘赊。\n朔北冻杀马，辽东买断牙。\n锦筵津颊玉，深户拥腮花。\n一罩山人帻，徒遮鬓发华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39082,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纳妾诗","author":"徐渭","text":"角枕覆衾长，新香异旧香。\n昔年曾射雉，此日复求凰。\n杏靥开春镜，鸦云换晚妆。\n夫君莫早起，初日未高梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39083,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骏霞篇为天台黄子赋","author":"徐渭","text":"芜市千金骏，天台一片霞。\n持将两神物，较许大名家。\n每过愁驴直，言归必日斜。\n御河生隔断，杨柳暗宫鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39084,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨俱幽沈大雅与杜并传","author":"徐渭","text":"潘家大谷梨，今遍九河堤。\n接树冰千鞠，单颗水一提。\n马驮香黑瓮，雁过脆红犀。\n未怕相如渴，王孙尽翠眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39085,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏","author":"徐渭","text":"杏有海东红，珍高百品中。\n色来先压市，子大欲沈笼。\n酿苦蜂何为，人甘蠹亦同。\n道旁繁李树，好去问王戎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39086,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李","author":"徐渭","text":"闽种夫人异，燕枝嘉庆同。\n蹊堪为李广，核可付王戎。\n碎玉当唇绿，飞饧绕臂红。\n归来忆滋味，能得几时醲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39087,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡桃","author":"徐渭","text":"羌果荐冰瓯，芳鲜占客楼。\n自应怀绿袖，何必定青州。\n嫩玉宁非乳，新苞一不油。\n秋风乾落近，腾贵在鸡头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39088,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白樱桃","author":"徐渭","text":"樱桃琥珀珠，一树忽砗磲。\n入袖迷吴苧，如珩信楚书。\n朱唇尝处讶，翠叶冻边舒。\n欲问丹阳鸟，曾衔此类无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39089,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"土豆","author":"徐渭","text":"榛实软不及，菰根旨定雌。\n吴沙花落子，蜀国叶蹲鸱。\n配茗人犹未，随羞箸似知。\n娇颦非不赏，憔悴浣纱时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39090,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薯蓣","author":"徐渭","text":"扶中识旧方，爽吻得新尝。\n脏廪衰年坏，山薯此地良。\n芋魁徒软美，松粉藉餦餭。\n楚些郱遗此，清酥点蔗霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39091,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铁脚","author":"徐渭","text":"吴下绵披细，燕中铁唔纤。\n俄为群少炙，祗用一竿黏。\n暗雪辞饥啄，红椒飶醉髯。\n窥螳黄雀事，公子慎金丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39092,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鼠","author":"徐渭","text":"幸不为残啮，何由冒劣名。\n庖厨穷口腹，天地窘生成。\n浅草遮人拙，深膏傍烛明。\n断齑吾自分，食肉任干城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39093,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半痴","author":"徐渭","text":"厄与痴相半，禽将鼠共县。\n味虽供客好，名却使人怜。\n所下惟双箸，何妨少一拳。\n如闻三嗅叟，笑杀雉羹筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39094,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"帆樯报荔支，犹忆海南时。\n一邑明勾漏，千罂枕蜜脾。\n消中随蔗往，高树放猿之。\n近日肝肠别，依稀饿采薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39095,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔支 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"当醉更须醉，当飧便买飧。\n几年千里外，一颗百金难。\n飞骑休轻刺，垂猩且夺看。\n老甜今巳矣，世味饱咸酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39096,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"熊","author":"徐渭","text":"李广射熊归，生肩付大儿。\n都无一寸白，傥有几条笞。\n腊掌吾曾饫，鲜蹯胜略差。\n穷饕亦何剧，急鲊白鱼迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39097,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄羊","author":"徐渭","text":"紫塞黄羊美，超腾不易供。\n蹄虽千里外，命寄一厨中。\n谁致西河俎，言穿老上弓。\n宾筵三动指，早晚到驼峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39098,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河豚","author":"徐渭","text":"白下酒家檐，河豚荻笋尖。\n寒江晴后雪，烂柳窾中鲇。\n万事随评品，诸鳞属并兼。\n惟应西子乳，臣妾百无盐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39099,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛鸿胪左官袁州","author":"徐渭","text":"佐郡袁州去，江行万里西。\n兴牵春水雁，心断早朝鸡。\n蛮境风烟近，巫乡习俗迷。\n正须烦料理，滕阁未遑跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39100,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨","author":"徐渭","text":"一雨连秋夏，无朝不冥迷。\n晓添四壁篆，夜助百虫悽。\n蒙羃遮城漏，蒸潮汗础泥。\n直愁衡岱顶，亦障海乌飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39101,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕霞 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"明霞剪脚齐，茜水入霄泥。\n雁鹜千行外，岩峦一角西。\n石家锦步帐，海国紫玻瓈。\n安取挥戈术，相留莫遣飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39102,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕霞 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"明霞烂且都，雨歇霁霄铺。\n万国楼台莫，孤村烟火晡。\n波鳞销琥珀，海色上珊瑚。\n一抹须弥翠，胭脂月镜孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39103,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕霞 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"元气渺太素，丹铅何所妆。\n白鱼劳尾变，红石补天长。\n剩付烟岚彩，全并沆瀣光。\n俄飞一片紫，骑凤是萧娘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39104,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送某子北上","author":"徐渭","text":"送子有所思，秋风来何翩。\n拜翁挂貂处，谈我篝灯前。\n枣红刍马店，霜白听鸡天。\n一队长鞭里，轻寒早著绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39105,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"某君中贡选送之","author":"徐渭","text":"物有幽奇者，飞腾各擅方。\n巨鱼须北化，细芷不南香。\n在狱持何赠，穿泥以剑将。\n回思成一笑，君自有鱼肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39106,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人言凤尾蕉花于某县庭命作","author":"徐渭","text":"凤尾本蕉材，红花绿叶毸。\n县庭今一见，蛮地不曾开。\n孔雀羞金翠，萧娘坐粉腮。\n颖川黄霸在，辛苦送祥来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39107,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿葛贞母","author":"徐渭","text":"终岁不成妆，钗寒古凤凰。\n诗堪将柏赋，年亦与松长。\n列女谁同传，称人果未亡。\n当筵思举案，误递百年觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39108,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥元日雪酌梅花馆 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"秋叶巳凋疏，春林积雪初。\n溪藤不复买，裙练免偷书。\n挂碧来鸣鸟，虽红补破庐。\n待予新买屋，自种两三株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39109,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥元日雪酌梅花馆 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"花叶看虽少，藤稍绕更赊。\n苍须摇水雪，白玉碾龙蛇。\n碧气将檐薄，浓阴夺竹斜。\n去年深夏热，特地为予遮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39110,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏送某客入广","author":"徐渭","text":"海南多宝地，客也傍春行。\n涉岭梅丸绽，当廛荔子明。\n百香番贾舶，双翠美人缨。\n会向青楼去，时呼艇子乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39111,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨舟载鹤诗","author":"徐渭","text":"买鹤载归去，况逢风雨天。\n客装兼有此，江影两潇然。\n湿重毸孤雪，波长立暮烟。\n园池宁有此，漠漠迥堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39112,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕之辰偕友人集九里之天瓦寒泉二庵各赋","author":"徐渭","text":"寻常难淡泊，况复值兹辰。\n山水留吾辈，灯花媚别人。\n言归城市去，似别武陵春。\n一路梅花水，今年弄月新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39113,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟寿长春祠何老","author":"徐渭","text":"云母何姑粉，增城几叶春。\n冯心行好事，作屋住仙人。\n锻柳堆山铁，眠松弄水银。\n面上桃花色，流年始七旬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39114,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京中送友人南归","author":"徐渭","text":"不道归真急，翻嫌握手迟。\n绿蝇秋渐少，黄鸟日相思。\n以我尚未去，问君来几时。\n答言春尽后，北雁与同飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蔡安父之黄州","author":"徐渭","text":"安父黄州去，乃当中夏时。\n榴花作火艳，梅雨烂蚕丝。\n研墨沄沄燥，窗书叶叶吹。\n今朝霁如此，别马快风嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与葛景文","author":"徐渭","text":"冬潦无人出，君胡为来欤。\n山楼隔年病，江渡几封书。\n健后堪风雨，贫来无菜蔬。\n不能留一饭，归去寺烟馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画红梅","author":"徐渭","text":"即使胭脂点，犹成冷淡枝。\n杏花无此干，铁树少其姿。\n挂壁纷红雪，围春在锦池。\n无由飘一的，娇杀寿阳眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"徐渭","text":"万物贵取影，写竹更宜然。\n秾阴不通鸟，碧浪自翻天。\n戛戛俱鸣石，迷迷别有烟。\n直须文与可，把笔取神传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筵中漫赠王良秀笔史","author":"徐渭","text":"囊琴三尺馀，投我主人居。\n老叟能称隐，诸郎总解书。\n夜深时唤酒，春尽共骑驴。\n去到西湖上，梅花带雪舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门逢孔将军于塾","author":"徐渭","text":"旧日堪为将，今来复授经。\n主人盛供帐，醉尉止都亭。\n终岁只在野，因予一入城。\n相悲十年事，泪落酒杯平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书倪元镇画","author":"徐渭","text":"一幅淡烟光，云林笔有霜。\n峰头横片石，天际渺长苍。\n虽赝须金换，如真胜壁藏。\n偏舟归去景，入画亦茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"徐渭","text":"翁也专枢密，侬今职赞襄。\n西京留守重，北帽侍中方。\n陵气松鳞紫，湖霜藕叶黄。\n江南秋色好，此去满帆樯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得草窗篇为周卫卿之号","author":"徐渭","text":"草绿鸟喈喈，閒窗一斗开。\n百虫堪上笔，一片欲遮苔。\n莫影纱纹瀫，春芽老氏孩。\n元公有知不，一笑陇牛堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食虎眼","author":"徐渭","text":"虎眼白琉璃，谁能隶虎皮。\n小毬蜂粉结，高液鸟群司。\n妇去茶如荠，王归胆亦饴。\n由来甘苦柄，舌观岂能持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]